

If all lines are on the same line, call back and request LINEFEEDS.@P120

If you see two of everything you type, turn off your terminal's ECHO or
HALF DUPLEX. You should be set to NO ECHO and FULL DUPLEX.

If you are getting everything capitalized, turn it off from the [U]ser
record command at the Main Menu.

For other problems, check your terminal's setup. You should be set to
8 bit words, 1 stop bit, no parity.


